{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119121306236-1119_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261119134338\"/><p>特朗普（左）和習近平（右）較早前在深圳出席APEC領導人非正式會議。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>中國國家主席習近平和美國總統特朗普周四（19日）下午1時30分左右開始在深圳舉行雙邊會談，之後會共進工作午餐。</p><p>特朗普結束與俄羅斯總統普京的雙邊會談後，轉往麒麟山莊會晤習近平。特朗普和習近平中美國旗前合照，然後開始會談。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:03:58.976137+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T04:13:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:57:30.963314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:57:30.963314+00:00","content_hash":"98fa0a3a8ad841ff5f47065c3f81a80a83106e3b665bc284c2c9b4bfc0190311","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}